  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### I am trying to re-run payroll for this month as there is an additional employee\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 26 Mar, 2019 at  1:20 PM\n\nPlease follow below steps to rerun the payroll.\n\n - Please download the HMRC response for the submitted FPS and delete the payroll (refer attached).\n - You have to rerun the payroll for the employee with the late reason (refer attached).\n - You have to select the same pay date while running the payroll.\n - Submit the FPS to the HMRC.\n\nPlease refer below screenshots for more help.\n\nClick here to watch how to restore a deleted employee\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115223\">Payroll</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188558\">Payroll FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">I am trying to re-run payroll for this month as there is an additional employee\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 26 Mar, 2019 at  1:20 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p>   </p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please follow below steps to rerun the payroll.<br><br></span></p><ol><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please download the HMRC response for the submitted FPS and delete the payroll (refer attached).</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You have to rerun the payroll for the employee with the late reason (refer attached).</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You have to select the same pay date while running the payroll.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Submit the FPS to the HMRC.</span></li></ol><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please refer below screenshots for more help.</span><br><br><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074214029/original/tMOSZedQW23BFu4sedW2X5S_EY15cxdsXg.png?1553596525\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074214029/original/tMOSZedQW23BFu4sedW2X5S_EY15cxdsXg.png?1553596525\" data-fileid=\"9074214029\" data-uniquekey=\"1553596445403\"></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074214025/original/MEltQ5hSgNh87XaRkeBZyPTdIJQBg9jQug.png?1553596524\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074214025/original/MEltQ5hSgNh87XaRkeBZyPTdIJQBg9jQug.png?1553596524\" data-fileid=\"9074214025\" data-uniquekey=\"1553596445403\"></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074214027/original/r-nsRFQWtyXbOq6wY3N2cHwgyuyyZWa6kA.png?1553596525\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074214027/original/r-nsRFQWtyXbOq6wY3N2cHwgyuyyZWa6kA.png?1553596525\" data-fileid=\"9074214027\" data-uniquekey=\"1553596445403\"></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074214031/original/RZmXX10P95SHVWamrTsXFi_7R1NfY_D1Fg.png?1553596525\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074214031/original/RZmXX10P95SHVWamrTsXFi_7R1NfY_D1Fg.png?1553596525\" data-fileid=\"9074214031\" data-uniquekey=\"1553596445403\"></p><p><br></p><div rel=\"clipboard_data\"><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/eb01356c221f47dca99b8ab136f3bf76\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click here to watch how to restore a deleted employee</span></strong></a></p></div><p> </p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165674\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165674/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link